  Desktop 1120px/mobile 390px previews: all images load, no page/table overflow.
  All six guide diagrams parse; 87 relative references, old CLI flags and screenshot order verified.
  Ruff and 11 targeted branding/export tests passed, including unchanged-master/repeatability checks.
  All six guide diagrams rendered to SVG. All 16 previous front-page images retained.
  Release candidate includes all eight graphics, four fonts, both licenses and three guides;
  exact master-logo hash, README bytes and private-context exclusions verified.
  Final provenance uses a clean public-input commit before regenerating artifacts.
  User visual approval remains unrecorded.
